WEBVTT

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:01.550
Thank you.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:07.240
You

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:40.660
Hi Mr. Howell.

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:42.040
I don't know, Billy.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:46.730
Let's find out.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.070
What do you make of that symbol, Malcolm?

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:53.860
I don't know how.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.610
Does it mean anything to you, Tal Shatali?

00:02:58.860 --> 00:02:59.920
Men of the hills are gathering.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.560
The symbol says,

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.970
that the white men are to be driven from the valley of tombs.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:05.700
Lieutenant.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.110
Close the stockade gate.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:13.430
Man the machine guns.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:14.060
Yes, sir.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:15.920
Close those gates!

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:18.140
Take your places. Man the gun.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:27.440
Give me a hand.

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:29.480
I'm ready.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:30.540
This may be serious.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:31.360
What causes this attack?

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:32.740
The legend one.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:36.800
No white man shall desecrate the valley of tomb.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.110
Thank you.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:39.890
That is not a true legend.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.490
When there's desecration.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:45.910
Scorpio will erupt.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.710
See for yourself, there is no eruption.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:52.470
You have spilled blood without reason.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.310
Return to your people.

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:58.910
counsel them to await a sign from Scorpio.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:04:59.860
Shelby.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.180
as you say, Twan.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.010
The true ledger must not be violated.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.480
The white men must leave.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:11.520
There is a curse which says that any white man that enters the Valley of Torm shall die.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:13.750
coming back.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.220
It looks as if Taro Chitali was successful.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:17.500
I hope so.

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:25.050
Is the attack over?

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:25.750
Who are they?

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:26.510
What do they want?

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.430
We will not be attacked again.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.000
If we stop our work...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.180
in the tombs and depart.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.780
But our visas and permits are in order.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.850
The chief warns that no permit will protect us from the curse of the scorpion.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.760
if we enter the inner tomb.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:44.270
The only reason I financed this expedition was to examine the contents of that tomb.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.630
Surely you're not going to be stopped by a native curse. It's superstitious nonsense.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.870
That's what everybody said about the curse of King Tut's tomb.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:52.160
But a lot of them died.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:53.460
We'll handle this, Billy.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:55.340
We'll open the tomb at once.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:59.670
We strike camp in the morning and be well on our way before there is any further danger from the natives.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:01.660
That suit you, Talcher Tally.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:04.700
I wish our danger came only from the natives.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.400
You don't take this curse of the scorpion seriously.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:08.660
Believe me, gentlemen.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.150
There is a curse of the scorpion.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.400
Nonsense. We'll be seeing ghosts next.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.440
Let's get to what?

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.990
When you and Carlisle get these specimens back to camp, we'll be glad to.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.560
There's an inscription here.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.900
Can you translate it title to tally?

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:01.950
Yes, I can translate it.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:07.730
This is...

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:11.480
Let what reposes behind this stone...

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:15.060
remain hidden from the eyes of mankind?

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:18.720
We'll be right back.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:19.160
time.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:22.790
Why, the secret of the Scorpion dynasty must lie beyond this wall.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.720
Perhaps it would be wise.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.280
Not to learn what that secret is.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.200
That's ridiculous.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.660
Well, I think Mr. Talcitalia's right.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.800
I feel as though I are robbing a grave right now.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:36.880
That's right, Billy.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.190
No, sir.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:40.490
I just don't want to pry into anybody's secrets.

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:43.910
I'll go into these passages and remove that pottery for you,

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.250
but I don't want any part of this.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:45.980
Very well.

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:54.040
Batson is the wisest one among us.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.100
I think I shall follow his example.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:01.680
If I may be excused.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:03.120
Just as you like.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:19.800
Ben!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:22.920
It's not a tomb at all!

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:36.500
What on earth is it?

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:37.770
Well, that's hard to say.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.670
Why, these are lenses of a sort.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.490
They're probably a fused quartz of some kind.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:47.710
Well, if this is the dreaded secret of the Scorpion dynasty, it seems to be quite harmless now.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.280
Sunlight seems to have something to do with it.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.350
Why? These lenses are adjustable.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:08:59.920
Here, bring them all to me.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.300
focus

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:14.780
my name is all is known to me your name is billy batson you did not pry into the secret of the

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:23.820
scorpion that is why i am here but where did you come from out of the past my son down through

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:29.250
the ages to guard the secret of the scorpion you've been alive all these years

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:37.190
you call life returned to me when your friends violated the tomb of the scorpion well they meant

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:44.940
no harm then they should have obeyed the inscription on the tomb the harm has been done it is your duty

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:53.450
to see that the curse of the scorpion is not visited upon innocent people my duty yes so long

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:59.680
as the golden scorpion may fall into the hands of selfish men it is the duty of captain marvel

