00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:06.820
You are, my son.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:12.980
All that is necessary is to repeat my name, Shazan.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:17.900
By its repetition, you will become Captain Marvel

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:22.240
and take on the virtues you see recorded there.

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:29.980
Wisdom of Solomon, the strength of...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:42.660
hercules the stamina of atlas the power of zeus the great courage of achilles and the speed of

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:51.640
mercury you must never call upon this power except in the service of right to do so would bring the

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:59.840
scorpions curse upon your own head and now my son repeat my name and return to the rescue

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.880
