00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:20.670
That device there. Call the others.

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:24.110
We've got to get Lang and Fisher up to camp.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.040
You bring the scorpion.

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:28.560
Take care of this Skrull, Bentley.

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:35.690
It is set forth here that a certain arrangement of the lenses

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:42.370
will transmute any substance placed in front of the base lens pure gold.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:43.750
That's impossible.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.520
Sounds like rubbish to me.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.010
