What do you propose?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.570
lenses be distributed among us let another take the scorpion itself and in that way the device

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:09.670
could never be used without the consent of all but what about the scroll the scorpion is useless

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:14.650
without it i suggest that billy batson be entrusted with the scroll oh but he's so young

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:21.210
how and this is of such vast importance nevertheless billy is probably the only one among us who can't

