translate it oh but mr howell i would i think mr howell's plan is excellent tell you charlie

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.380
will you disassemble the lenses please

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:56.780
professor fisher carlisle the bentley the lang the malcolm and billy this is for you to guard

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.060
see that you guarded well

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.540
It contains a precious...

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:03.920
And a dangerous secret.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.180
Don't worry, Tal Chetali.

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:07.370
I'll guard it.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.410
Well said, young fellow. I'm sure you will.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.220
See that your personal belongings are packed tonight.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.660
We start to load at 4 o'clock in the morning.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:16.780
Start for the base camp at daylight.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:43.980
signal

