Radio the British troops at Fort Moultan.

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:33.370
Tell them we need immediate aid.

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:45.790
Yes, sir. 624 calling Fort Moultan.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:49.870
Malcolm Archaeological Expedition on 624 calling Fort Moultan.

